Types of cancer
❖ Cancers are classified by the origin of the tumor:
考
❑ Carcinoma (癌): derived from epithelial cells (上皮细胞);
❑ Sarcoma (肉瘤): derived from connective tissue (结缔组织);
❑ Blastoma (母细胞瘤): derived from immature "precursor" cells or
embryonic tissue;
❑ Lymphoma (淋巴癌) and leukemia (白血病): derived from
hematopoietic cells (造血细胞);
❑ Germ cell tumor: derived from pluripotent cells (多能细胞).
