Hallmarks of cancer cells
❖ The morphological features of cancer cells:
❑ Many cells that continue to grow and divide;
❑ Variations in size of cells;
❑ Variations in shapes of cells;
❑ Nucleus that is larger and darker;
❑ Abnormal number of chromosomes;
❑ Disorganized chromosomes;
❑ Cluster of cells without clear boundary.
https://www.verywellhealth.com/

Hallmarks of cancer cells
❖ The biological features of cancer cells:
考
❑ Cell growth absent the proper signals, 无生长信号也可生长;
❑ Loss of sensitivity to anti-growth signals, 停止生长信号失灵;
❑ Avoidance of programmed cell death, 无程序性死亡;
❑ Limitless number of cell divisions, 永生化;
❑ Acquisition of ability of invasion, 浸润侵袭能力；
❑ Promoting angiogenesis, 促血管生长;
❑ Acquisition of ability to seed metastases, 转移能力.
