Topoisomerase inhibitors
❖ Topoisomerases (拓扑异构酶) relax DNA supercoiling during
考
replication and transcription:
❑ Type I (TopoI) transiently cleaves single stranded DNA;
❑ Type II (TopoII) transiently cleaves double stranded DNA.
❖ CCNSA & CCSA (S/G2 phase).
❖ TopoI inhibitors: Camptothecins (喜树碱类);
